IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ldica-protection`

-- Layout-Designs of Integrated Circuits Act 1999, ss 2, 5, 6, 7, 10, 11, 17, 18, 23 to 25 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_layout-designs-of-integrated-circuits-act-1999.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`Singapore itself` MEANS Country WITH
    `is Singapore` IS TRUE
    `is a member of the World Trade Organisation` IS TRUE
    `is designated by the Minister under section 31` IS FALSE

`a WTO member abroad` MEANS Country WITH
    `is Singapore` IS FALSE
    `is a member of the World Trade Organisation` IS TRUE
    `is designated by the Minister under section 31` IS FALSE

`a designated non-member` MEANS Country WITH
    `is Singapore` IS FALSE
    `is a member of the World Trade Organisation` IS FALSE
    `is designated by the Minister under section 31` IS TRUE

`a Singapore citizen designer` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is a natural person` IS TRUE
    `is a national of, domiciled or ordinarily resident in a covered country` IS TRUE
    `is incorporated or formed in a covered country` IS FALSE
    `has a real and effective design or chip-making establishment in a covered country` IS FALSE
    `is the Government or the government of a qualifying country` IS FALSE

`a foreign individual with no link` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is a natural person` IS TRUE
    `is a national of, domiciled or ordinarily resident in a covered country` IS FALSE
    `is incorporated or formed in a covered country` IS FALSE
    `has a real and effective design or chip-making establishment in a covered country` IS FALSE
    `is the Government or the government of a qualifying country` IS FALSE

