§ `s 2`

#ASSERT NOT `the country is a qualifying country` `Singapore itself`
#ASSERT `the country is a qualifying country` `a WTO member abroad`
#ASSERT `the country is a qualifying country` `a designated non-member`

#ASSERT `the claimant is a qualified person` `a Singapore citizen designer`
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant is a qualified person` `a foreign individual with no link`
#ASSERT `the claimant is a qualified person` `an individual running a chip fab in a covered country`
#ASSERT `the claimant is a qualified person` `a company incorporated in a covered country`
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant is a qualified person` `an unconnected company`

#ASSERT `the claimant is a qualified owner` `an unconnected company` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant is a qualified owner` `an unconnected company` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the claimant is a qualified owner` `an unconnected company` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant is a qualified owner` `a Singapore citizen designer` FALSE FALSE FALSE

§ `s 6`

#ASSERT `the owner of the layout-design` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the creator`
#ASSERT `the owner of the layout-design` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the employer`
#ASSERT `the owner of the layout-design` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the person who commissioned it`
#ASSERT `the owner of the layout-design` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `whoever the agreement names`

§ `ss 5, 7`

#ASSERT `the year of creation` 2015 2013 EQUALS 2013

#ASSERT `the last calendar year of protection` `a design exploited in its year of creation` EQUALS 2020
#ASSERT `the last calendar year of protection` `a design exploited five years after creation` EQUALS 2025
#ASSERT `the last calendar year of protection` `a design exploited six years after creation` EQUALS 2025
#ASSERT `the last calendar year of protection` `a design never exploited` EQUALS 2025

#ASSERT `the design is protected in` `a design exploited in its year of creation` 2020
#ASSERT NOT `the design is protected in` `a design exploited in its year of creation` 2021
#ASSERT `the design is protected in` `a design never exploited` 2025
#ASSERT NOT `the design is protected in` `a design never exploited` 2026
#ASSERT NOT `the design is protected in` `a design created in 1998` 2005
#ASSERT NOT `the design is protected in` `an unoriginal design` 2012

§ `ss 9, 10, 11, 23, 24`

#ASSERT `the conduct infringes` `a pirate copier and seller`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a hobbyist copying privately`
#ASSERT `the conduct infringes` `a private copier who later sells`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a university lab copying for research`
#ASSERT `the conduct infringes` `a lab that sells its research copies`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a reverse engineer selling a new original design`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `an independent creator of an identical design`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a parallel importer of genuine chips`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `an innocent reseller still unaware`
#ASSERT `the conduct infringes` `a reseller who learns and does not pay`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a reseller who learns and pays`
#ASSERT `the conduct infringes` `the Government selling copies to the public`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct infringes` `a copier of an expired design`

§ `s 17`

#ASSERT `the person aggrieved may get relief` `a letter threatening a retailer for selling`
#ASSERT NOT `the person aggrieved may get relief` `a notice that the right exists`
#ASSERT NOT `the person aggrieved may get relief` `a threat to sue an importer for importing`
#ASSERT NOT `the person aggrieved may get relief` `a threat over acts shown to infringe`

§ `s 18`

#ASSERT `the assignment is effective` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the assignment is effective` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the licence binds the successor` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the licence binds the successor` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the licence binds the successor` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE

§ `s 25`

#ASSERT `when the Government must inform the owner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `promptly`
#ASSERT `when the Government must inform the owner` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no duty to inform`

